  "label": "User projected onto the scene of a shocked woman experiencing a parenting mishap",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual and textual elements of the meme, specifically the scene of the woman in shock and the text describing the parenting mishap. The text explicitly uses 'your son', which directly addresses the user as a parent, creating an implicit 'you' projection. The user identifies with the emotional state and situation depicted, making the woman's exaggerated shock a visual representation of the user's own potential reaction to a similar parenting error. The projection is onto the 'shocked_woman_scene' and the 'text_chunk', which together form the core of the meme's relatable humor.",
